Book Catalogue (Julia Iezzi) 

Frontend: HTML, CSS and JavaScript interface for viewing, searching, adding and editing books, including ISBN lookup and linked author information. 

API (C#): ASP.NET Core API with GET, POST and PUT endpoints for book management, DELETE functionality for book-author associations, and Open Library integration for ISBN lookup. 

Database: Integration with SQL Server tables ral.ral_Books and ral.ral_BookAuthors. 

Stored Procedures: Integration with Wayne’s ral_Books_CRUD_JSON, ral_BookAuthors_CRUD_JSON, ral_SearchBooks_JSON and ral_ScanBook_JSON procedures. 

